{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's Health and Lifestyle Column"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Personality Profile"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Someone's Feelings and Reactions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You talk about feelings and reactions using adjectives.<br/><br/>Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> are used to describe how a person feels, like <span class=\"italic\">annoyed, fascinated, entertained, surprised, worried</span> or <span class =\"italic\">tired</span>.<br/><br/>Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ing</span> are used to describe things and situations, like <span class =\"italic\">annoying, entertaining, surprising, worrying</span> or <span class =\"italic\">tiring</span>.  <br/>These adjectives describe the <span class =\"italic\">effect</span> something has on a person."}, {"type": "example", "content": " The results of the test can be surprising or even shocking."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are you excited about the idea of challenge? Do you feel annoyed when people disagree with you?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Speculating about Feelings and Impressions  "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you speculate about something, you are making a guess based on what you know about the situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can show you are speculating about something by using a modal, like <span class =\"italic\">must</span> or <span class =\"italic\">can't</span>. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The modal is followed by a verb in the base form. You do not use \u201cto\u201d."}, {"type": "text", "content": "These are formal structures."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Personality tests are very popular. People must enjoy thinking about their personality."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The Myers-Briggs test separates people into 16 well-defined categories. In my opinion, that can't always be the case. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shocking"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very surprising, to the point of feeling shocked"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  The results of personality tests can be surprising or even shocking."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about personality."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "entertaining"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "fun, amusing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Whatever you think about the results of your tests, it's entertaining to talk about personality."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "well-defined"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "definite; separate"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Myers-Briggs test separates people into 16 well-defined categories. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "annoyed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "feeling unhappy; irritated"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are you annoyed when people disagree with you?  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "executive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the person responsible for a company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If so, you are probably an executive type."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob05aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a